-/// Borrowed-carry form of [`cuccaro_add_fast_low_to_ext_topclean`]. The caller
-/// supplies the low/mid carry lanes; the highest `clean_top` carries are hosted
-/// in-place on source lanes by the Cuccaro MAJ/UMA suffix.
